  "canonicalOwner": "Existing macro/carbohydrate policy parsers, resolveTargetSettings, calculateSummary, settings.save and inactive-energy reconciliation own values and calculations. Three narrow commands adapt original source custom-energy, above-baseline and restore-defaults patches. Existing authenticated preview and workspace receipt handle requests. No schema or domain arithmetic changed.",
  "behavior": [
    "Source energy card and breakdown, ratios/fixed/keto controls, derived grams and energy, advanced percent/ratio units, presets and captured keto provenance.",
    "Custom energy keeps inactive Weight Goal; switching back restores it. Above-baseline, carbohydrate deductions and restore defaults preserve unrelated targets, expenditure, display and schedules.",
    "Default projections exclude macroPlan only; effective scheduled day projections remain separate. Missing and zero macros retain their identities.",
    "Pending edits disable secondary actions. Cancel aborts preview; malformed captures cannot save. Custom Energy retains input on preview failure. Ambiguous save retries identical request; stale state requires reload.",
    "Diary Energy Summary settings mount the same source screen. Diary Target opens its selected-day custom-target editor. Superseded generic global macro/energy/carbohydrate forms are removed."
  ],
